stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PENDING: pipeline submits a quarantined file
  PENDING --> UNDER_REVIEW: reviewer holds it
  PENDING --> APPROVED_PENDING_VALIDATION: approve
  UNDER_REVIEW --> APPROVED_PENDING_VALIDATION: approve
  PENDING --> REJECTED: delete
  UNDER_REVIEW --> REJECTED: delete
  APPROVED_PENDING_VALIDATION --> REJECTED: delete
  APPROVED_PENDING_VALIDATION --> UNDER_REVIEW: hold, takes the approval back
  APPROVED_PENDING_VALIDATION --> RELEASED: publish.yml after the checks pass again
  APPROVED_PENDING_VALIDATION --> PENDING: revalidation failed
  RELEASED --> PENDING: revalidation failed later
  REJECTED --> [*]
